			"notes": "## [2.7.0](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/compare/1.20.1-v2.6.2...1.20.1-v2.7.0) (2026-08-14)\n\n### ✨ Features\n\n* add config option to prevent hostiles from spawning in lush caves ([1a133f1](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/1a133f198f2aa3aa537b453fc915fb7b7b9b3e22))\n* add custom spawning logic for critters in lush caves ([8725d33](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/8725d33463b3bbfcd25900add198224477163b0a))\n* add migration strategy to new config defaults ([81cefb3](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/81cefb3f80147c47884f5eb2f9cc10abfeb770b5))\n* add new baby variants ([a6216e3](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/a6216e3ea51a3a307e74369c7d32cc48963d093c))\n* add recipe to turn clams into bone meal ([879fac3](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/879fac3fabc89e10001131751711a2f312621b67))\n* add recipe to turn snail slime bottles into slime balls ([7237c24](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/7237c24a8b44655b388c548255d12e8a0f6393ea))\n* **dragonfly:** add netherite armor ([e55280e](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/e55280e61070a47447da437e9839ad1e7f7e0610))\n* **grappling-hook:** add config option for disabling durability ([f7cc3cb](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/f7cc3cbad379bf6a3d38784aa03c9cd09084403c))\n* **leaf-insect:** will eat dropped leaf block items, dropping an item from the block's loot table ([b8c02fe](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/b8c02fe4d32ad140c0b5534b7c7ee5eba8345a7b))\n* new sitting and sleeping behaviours for ferrets and red pandas ([3fcd2ea](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/3fcd2ea94b728afe2f87978cda7a58fdeadae8e2))\n* **shima-enaga:** add wing flapping sounds ([8dfa01f](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/8dfa01fa1849f5960375aa1bd9f28c16c74253ec))\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n* don't generate silk cocoons in water ([f49c91f](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/f49c91f3115edb5d5da48af51a4656fd1062a42c))\n* **dumbo-octopus:** correctly play bubble pop sound ([169d754](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/169d754126b5797c81994ac288008528674d2721))\n* **dumbo-octopus:** resolve bubble not being visible ([90a1074](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/90a1074e8a451b7b1f63094dfaa2b9434595cd76))\n* **ferret:** don't attack tamed animals ([9857254](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/9857254c266ed4c0ec250098638ae7c05524e867)), closes [#179](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/issues/179)\n* make netherite dragonfly armor smithable ([c564d17](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/c564d17bf053e009b49938408d8c941365a33e87))\n* **otter:** resolve baby floating animation glitch ([64e6d50](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/64e6d5000c3c6d017e68401acde1cde4e8688ac6))\n* **otter:** resolve infinite eating fish without food component glitch ([4336162](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/43361625257e930856aab336b643df0d9c04dfbe))\n* **red-panda:** resolve animation head rotation issues ([606024b](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/606024bae4c8ec07901db8df47e4162422d37080))\n* **red-panda:** resolve scaring animation glitch ([f0743d5](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/f0743d522dd97b1e8f3b98e816c9d6ea133a88b4))\n* remove untamed/unnamed animals when far away ([10c162a](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/10c162a342d4a41c5e16c3d74a478016de245a7e))\n* resolve potential issue with custom loot modifiers ([9fb25f4](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/9fb25f44fbfb0532e68cf5c5085b4ea18d4f3701))\n\n..."
