			"notes": "## [2.7.0](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/compare/1.21.1-v2.6.2...1.21.1-v2.7.0) (2026-08-14)\n\n### ✨ Features\n\n* add config option to prevent hostiles from spawning in lush caves ([e611c37](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/e611c37e611f32e65056db225c7a5fc70b97f1f7))\n* add custom spawning logic for critters in lush caves ([1500c04](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/1500c043cd5184ef08acebf4537a10c675c88d94))\n* add migration strategy to new config defaults ([a58359a](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/a58359a828d9938bbaf26d2b1608754fa71f413f))\n* add new baby variants ([4509047](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/4509047233dd5e1467bcaf3e3ba120c4c0502634))\n* add recipe to turn clams into bone meal ([6042037](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/604203738af06ff2be605c11dd73d46983c785d8))\n* add recipe to turn snail slime bottles into slime balls ([455d20e](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/455d20e86aaa67ab9bbfecb56630fe669ea2b10e))\n* **dragonfly:** add netherite armor ([cdf24d1](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/cdf24d1747fecec8219ebc53d589a88831121138))\n* **grappling-hook:** add config option for disabling durability ([7736280](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/77362806f4552377d46d54ad2bcb8f8d8337ff09))\n* **leaf-insect:** will search and eat dropped leaf block items, dropping an item from the block's loot table ([d11f587](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/d11f58777ff72af6566a655e483ac8176d8a2de9))\n* new sitting and sleeping behaviours for ferrets and red pandas ([9f8487d](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/9f8487d3f6589e4290304bdd731b8734f7a507da))\n* **shima-enaga:** add wing flapping sounds ([e320b5b](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/e320b5b827062dfc3bea5912f71abc2f2d811b82))\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n* correctly separate client logic in networking code ([e5e6521](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/e5e6521d65d23f8334ede5172e6f0e5702446149)), closes [#172](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/issues/172) [#173](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/issues/173)\n* don't generate silk cocoons in water ([5af0464](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/5af0464ba372d4ca68ec3eea857922b0c6cefdef))\n* **dumbo-octopus:** correctly play bubble pop sound ([97269d5](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/97269d5236f70a2cea5024963486a324dd7647a1))\n* **dumbo-octopus:** resolve bubble not being visible ([dd41720](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/dd4172083fa587af1577ee9a687854c7d5bc63c8))\n* **ferret:** don't attack tamed animals ([f3fd7d7](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/f3fd7d71a516fc62f853d555821d486f73a8ee67)), closes [#179](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/issues/179)\n* make netherite dragonfly armor smithable ([dd5e796](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/dd5e796c63917533b9db4d0fafa59b21d8fd91e6))\n* **otter:** resolve baby floating animation glitch ([f4498d4](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/f4498d4a361a1b71179067057fef4071fd04b1c7))\n* **otter:** resolve infinite eating fish without food component glitch ([e809af4](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/e809af47b9aef3c01f6179717dc0031e85a5b613)), closes [#175](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/issues/175)\n* **red-panda:** resolve animation head rotation issues ([3244bac](https://github.com/bonsaistudi0s/CrittersAndCompanions/commit/3244bac8be4eab38c04b214ba27243dd74176df6))\n\n..."
